      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_qJgpbq": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How does Boka BrightBoost Whitening Powder work?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>BrightBoost is an innovative, multi-benefit peroxide-free whitening formula. Formulated with stain-targeting PAP (Phthalimido-Peroxy-Caproic Acid), nano-hydroxyapatite, and probiotics, it is designed to gently brighten teeth, support enamel care, and promote oral wellness. BrightBoost powder removes surface stains without the harsh chemicals or sensitivity often found in traditional teeth whitening products.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_8eKAd6": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do you use whitening powder with n-Ha toothpaste?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>It’s simple! Apply your favorite nano-hydroxyapatite toothpaste to your brush, then dip the bristles into the BrightBoost powder. Brush thoroughly for two minutes and spit. For the best results, skip the rinse to allow the biomimetic minerals to stay in contact with your teeth longer.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_UedG3C": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to use whitening powder without toothpaste?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>To use BrightBoost powder without toothpaste, lightly wet the toothbrush and dip the bristles into the powder to coat, then brush as usual. It’s a water-free, portable option that’s perfect for travel or a quick on-the-go refresh.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_a9yPEf": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Does BrightBoost use hydrogen peroxide?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>No. We’ve swapped harsh bleaching agents for PAP to help remove surface stains gently and effectively. </p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_tGJ8At": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is this whitening powder safe for sensitive teeth?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Absolutely. Many people search for whitening for sensitive teeth, and BrightBoost powder is thoughtfully formulated to be exactly that. Our powder is also infused with aloe vera to ensure your whitening ritual is gentle and feel-good.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_KQENhP": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is PAP whitening and how does it work?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Stain-targeting PAP is a science-backed ingredient that focuses on breaking down discolorations from coffee, tea, or wine while remaining gentle on your enamel. It’s a nature-inspired way to achieve a bright, healthy-looking smile through regular brushing.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_DJy4D8": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I use BrightBoost Whitening Powder every day?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Yes! BrightBoost is safe for daily use and is a seamless addition to your morning or nightly oral hygiene routine to boost your pearly whites.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_VpVBX9": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Does BrightBoost Whitening Powder contain nano-hydroxyapatite (n-Ha)?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>It does. We included n-Ha because it mimics tooth enamel. While the PAP polishes teeth, the nano-hydroxyapatite supports enamel care, providing a holistic approach to your smile’s health. </p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_PknFhE": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What are the best ingredients for natural teeth polishing?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>We use Perlite and Kaolin, which are gentle, mineral-derived ingredients. These natural polishers work to smooth the tooth surface, helping to maintain brightness and leave your teeth feeling incredibly clean.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_gfEDyx": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is Boka BrightBoost Whitening Powder vegan and cruelty-free?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Integrity is our priority. BrightBoost Whitening Powder is PETA cruelty-free certified, vegan, and dye-free. It’s also packed with Vitamins A, C, and E to support your oral wellness while keeping your breath fresh with lemongrass mint.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_kc8Ajw": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Processing and Shipping Times",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>For orders placed with standard shipping, please allow 1-2 business days for processing and up to 5 business days for delivery. Exact timing can vary depending on size of the order and delivery destination. Orders placed after 1 p.m. EST on Fridays, over the weekend, or on major U.S. holidays will likely not be processed until the following business day. </p><p>Expedited orders placed after 10 a.m. EST may be shipped the following business day.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_FNKwU7": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Returns and Refunds",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p><strong>Returns</strong><br/></p><p>If you decide that you'd like to return your Boka product, please contact us to initiate a return within 30 days of purchase. We offer a full product cost refund (less any incurred shipping costs) within 30 days of your purchase.<br/><br/>To be eligible for a return, your item must be unused and in the same condition that you received it. It must also be in the original packaging.<br/><br/><strong>Refunds</strong><br/></p><p>Once your return is received and inspected, we will send you an email to confirm status of your return and refund.<br/><br/>If approved, your refund will be processed, and a credit will automatically be applied to your credit card or original method of payment, within a certain amount of days.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_AVjmT7": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do you have more questions about Boka?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Please <a href=\"mailto:hello@boka.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:hello@boka.com\">contact us </a>and we’ll get back to you as soon as possible.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
